<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif" />
      <mj-button background-color="#a44a20" color="#ffffff" border-radius="8px" font-size="15px" font-weight="600" padding="14px 32px" />
      <mj-divider border-color="#e9e0cf" border-width="1px" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f4efe4">
    <mj-raw>
      <div style="display:none;font-size:1px;color:#f4efe4;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">确认邮箱归属，{{ valid_hours }} 小时内有效</div>
    </mj-raw>
    <mj-section background-color="#f4efe4" padding="40px 16px">
      <mj-column background-color="#fffdf7" border="1px solid #e6dcc8" border-radius="12px" padding="40px 32px">
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <span style="display:inline-block;width:42px;height:42px;line-height:42px;background-color:#a44a20;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;">{{ project_name[:1] }}</span>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#8a4a20;letter-spacing:0.5px;">{{ project_name }}</div>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="28px 0 20px" font-size="22px" font-weight="700" color="#3a2f26" line-height="1.4">验证你的邮箱</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0 0 20px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.8" color="#5c5245">你好，欢迎使用 {{ project_name }}！<br />请点击下方按钮，确认 <strong style="color:#3a2f26;">{{ email }}</strong> 属于你本人，即可开始上传资料、提问与引用检索。</mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" padding="8px 0 26px" href="{{ link }}">验证邮箱</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0 0 16px" font-size="13px" line-height="1.7" color="#756a5c">验证链接将在 <strong style="color:#5c5245;">{{ valid_hours }} 小时</strong>内有效。若链接过期，登录后点击顶部提示即可重新发送。</mj-text>
        <mj-divider padding="0"></mj-divider>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="24px 0 16px" font-size="13px" line-height="1.7" color="#756a5c">如果按钮无法点击，请将以下链接复制到浏览器地址栏：</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0 0 16px" font-size="13px" line-height="1.6" color="#5c5245"><a href="{{ link }}" style="color:#8a4a20;word-break:break-all;">{{ link }}</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0" font-size="12px" line-height="1.7" color="#756a5c">如果你没有注册 {{ project_name }}，请忽略这封邮件，你的邮箱不会发生任何变更。<br />此邮件来自 {{ project_name }}（{{ brand_host }}），由系统自动发送，请勿直接回复。</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
